			"Entries": 
			{ "GetoSuguru_spouse": "Back in the city, I never really paid attention to natural phenomena, the things happening around me...$0#$b#But here in Pelican town, I feel like I'm seeing and learning something new every single day.$1#$b#And with you by my side, it feels even better, my love.$6",
