			"Target": "Data/Festivals/fall27",
			"Entries": 
			{ "GetoSuguru": "Wanna race? Whoever gets to the end of the maze first wins.$9#$b#Heh... just kidding. I still want to grab a serving of that heavenly mashed potatoes.$1",
