			"Action": "EditData",
			"Target": "Data/Festivals/fall27",
			"Entries": 
			{ "GetoSuguru_spouse": "You know, it would be fun to fish out some of my curses just to-$3#$b#Haha! I'm just kidding, darling. Don't be frowny now.$10#$b#%GetoSuguru gives you an apologetic peck on the cheek.",
