			"Action": "EditData",
			"Target": "Data/Festivals/winter25",
			"Entries": 
			{ "GetoSuguru": "Looking to grab some dessert too, hm?$0#$b#For real, though... that roasted turkey is heaven. Have you tried it?$1#$b#Hurry, before it disappears!$7",
			  "GetoSuguru_y2": "I actually made some of the cookies. Wanna try some, @?$0"
