		{	
			"LogName": "Feast of the Winter Star - Dialogue",
			"Action": "EditData",
			"Target": "Data/Festivals/winter25",
			"Entries": 
			{ "GetoSuguru_spouse": "Sweetheart, here we are, at the end of the year once again.$1#$b#I have nothing to say besides... thank you. For staying, for being something irreplaceable in my life. For existing.$6#$b#For making me feel like... I'm home.$4#$b#I love you, @. You're it for me. I don't plan on stopping, not by a long shot.$6",
			  "GetoSuguru_spouse_y2": "You are the best thing that the universe has ever granted to me, @...$6#$b#Haha, just a little emotional. I'm so happy that we got to spend yet another amazing year together.$1#$b#I love you, @.$4"
